# Setup, available launch commands and data boundaries: README.md / PROJECT_NAVIGATION.md.
# Review runs without environment variables or credentials.
# Use the documented dev:luna:test / start:luna:test launch commands for model tests;
# their temporary transport configuration is not a saved production provider setting.
# Optional desktop integration; install the connector separately and use its private sign-in.
# ZAICHANG_ZJU_SOURCE=/path/to/your/student-info-connector
# Optional isolated local desktop data directory (do not commit its contents).
# ZAICHANG_DATA_DIR=/path/to/an/empty/private-directory
